{
  "family": "input",
  "about": "What the navigator field keeps of a keystroke, and when the draft becomes a place. Geohash parses whole always — every normalized spelling is an address. S2 is whole-or-nothing: a partial token is not yet a place, a token past the floor clamps and re-tokenizes, and a non-token is refused with null.",
  "cases": [
